<title>UK: Equitable Life sets 350 mln stg perpetual bond.</title>
<headline>Equitable Life sets 350 mln stg perpetual bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EQUITABLE LIFE FINANCE PLC</p>
<p> AMT    350 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY  * PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    06.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+90 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED.</p>
<p>	     *CALLABLE AFTER 10-YEARS, THEN EVERY FIVE YEARS</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 10-YEAR GILT</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  EQUITABLE LIFE ASSURANCE SOCIETY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
